Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it's like in\Nthe Everlasting Stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's an unconquered place of darkness\Nat the lowest level of this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a big open area at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then a valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One so deep you can't see the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Past that, there are three straight paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's it. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gets even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the three, only the path that's\Non the right has ever been bested.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A certain hunter walked down\Nthat path for an entire year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seemed to stretch onward\Nin a straight line forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until eventually he\Nencountered a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that, they say, is why it's\Ncalled the Everlasting Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like I could die of\Nboredom just thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pidgey, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have had an iron\Nwill and super sensible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shoes to walk a dark\Npath for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear it took the hunter another\Nyear just to make it back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:01:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never so much as saw a\Nplant, much less a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would have normally starved to death,\Nbut it seems his blessing got him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you think maybe that's why\NCaptain Kerioyl wants Boxo so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know Sulream has the\Nblessing of transference,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it only works if she's been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they progress, warp back, and restock,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,repeating the cycle over and over again\Nwhenever they run out of food and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a brutal existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they had yours truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd be drowning in packaged food,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I could store their\Nstuff in my coin lockers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't sound amazing, but\Nwe'll suck it up and try our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet even a year will fly by in no\Ntime if we're together, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy as long as I'm with Foxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxo here will keep our bellies\Nnice and full, so no worries there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.92,0:01:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll all work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.20,0:01:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to rustle up a\Nteam of Unasusu to pull a wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad Kikoyu and Botan on\Na round to speed up our trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time sink will be our\Nbiggest sticking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of points, I pwned\Nthat mid-ranked shark general.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got honor and over a million points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ka-ching!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have 2,370,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so close to 3 mil I\Ncan practically smell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means your boy, Boxo, is this close\Nto knowing the glories of rank three!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back of\Nmy super strong partner, Llamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.72,0:02:43.76,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is mine, too. You can't give...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...or I can give...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, look, look. I can't\Ntell him the only thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep the effort of mini go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give... I can't give...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think... I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sue me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sue me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gather that on the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know. So now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be there. Yeah, it's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are here enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love that you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.04,0:03:55.96,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(358,434)\fscx77\pos(499,54)}Another Uproar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, I shall accompany\Nyou on your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would follow you off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will join your mission as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A long journey lends itself to\Nintrospection, which feeds the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unrelated, but long treks are\Nalso treacherous on footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to bring a\Nmountain of spare shoes with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will dispose of any worn-out pairs\Nonce they're too odorless and filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're going with Master Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should give us an\Noverwhelming advantage in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our attempt to conquer\Nthe Everlasting Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could possibly go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still can't afford to be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, something wrong, Heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thought, though I hate to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine the Netherlord\Nwon't be in favor of our trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, there's a strong chance he'll\Nattempt to sabotage us along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just received word that Pinky\NGeneral Kylings has broken out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goth, five-finger general we\Nnabbed in the Dark Forest Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure she's one of\Nthe Netherlord's baddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:04:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the guards survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of those guards were put to sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but thankfully they're\Nnot in any mortal danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We discovered they were sleeping when it\Ncame time for the scheduled shift change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, she had already vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her cell was completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blade had sliced through her bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were made of a special alloy that\Nwas designed to block her blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying someone with a\Nflair for martial arts did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumite, is such a thing even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could do the same thing\Nmyself if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a scary woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever broke her out is\Nimmensely talented. Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's trouble brewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hunter returned to our village after\Nan expedition, bringing a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a whole horde of monsters coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said there were at least 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about deja vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village is still recovering from\Nthe last time this trope happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coyowing's escape just got\Nslapped down the priority list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a horde all right, and\Nit's hornier than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those three types would\Nnormally be fighting each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're after us instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blame the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this means he's dead set against\Nus going to the Everlasting Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having you here in times of crisis\Ncertainly makes things much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the cool stuff, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We help each other very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we're currently housing a large\Nnumber of evacuees from other strata.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your kindness will be rewarded later\Nwhen you get the coins you're owed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's a good time to\Nsuck up on projectiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab some arrows and throwing knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also offer weapon and armor repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the stinky crisis we're\Nin, everything's free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take what you need and\Nplease don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see I'm not the only one hard at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so sweet of you\Nto hand out weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty extravagant even\Nfor you to not charge anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To quote the timeless wisdom of my father,\Nsometimes the best gain is to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's the perfect chance to\Nspend some good PR for our brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I was well-prepared and\Nalready stocked up far in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They obviously bought\Nup all those weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of concern for the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still over a kilometer away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird, they're not getting any closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they stalling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.44,0:07:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or amassing their forces\Nfor one big attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, guard duty's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:07:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go get some rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're together, at least till tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please promise to take a break\Nshould exhaustion overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder when our fierce\Nfoes will begin their march.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe\Nthey're not going to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should get this party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then we're toast if it\Nturns out to be a fiendish trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we continue waiting\Nor launch the first attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is there an even better option?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like your unfiltered\Nopinions on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want a hot take, I got\None ready and waiting for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go pulverize some monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're all here talking\Nabout our feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Monster Horde is\Ngetting bigger and badder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we choose to bring the fight to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we must prepare ourselves\Nfor heavy casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of lots of us dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't we wipe some of them\Nout with a small strike team?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not dying is at least\Nworth a try. That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be most\Neffective to chip away at
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their numbers by unleashing\Nsome powerful ranged attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I know where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're in the market for\Nwholesale destruction magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to get carried away, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll prepare a wagon for the strike\Nteam as well as the detachment of guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If things don't go our way, the team\Nwill immediately retreat to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By team, he means this grab\Nbag of named characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, and don't forget to come\Nrunning back if things go south.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be safe, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll turn tail and run if\Nthings get too dangerous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it'll win.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.09,0:09:43.10,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(496,147)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that box?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Gramps, don't you think we\Nshould already be in range by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director and Lamas, could you\Nplease park us over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoxie, Shui, prepare to counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready and waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La Is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need something, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, imp, ma 'i. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to do what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, imp, ma 'i, off the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you really want me to toss\Nyou up and flip you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning your bottom would be on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm locked and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but\Nif you're sure about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I hope you like\Nthe wind in your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concrete foundation blocks ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toss up with E.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's the reason\Nyou're upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that? It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make use of this\Nopportunity to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long as stay up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep using whatever Boxo\Ngives you to keep them at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity, lighten the wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Shui and Hoxie, feel\Nfree to fire away. Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plan B is unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, I'd say\Nthe monsters are probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being controlled by a skull ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means they can only follow\Nsimple orders like attack or retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By leading the horde of monsters\Npast the ramparts again and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again will gradually cut their\Nforces down to a manageable number?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hunt down any remnants!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking on this many\Ncrocodile fins won't be easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but our group should be able to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see frogs in need of flambing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't let you hog all the fun, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, perhaps you and I should do\Nsomething about those two snakes, eh, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer more of a\Nchallenge, but it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting alongside you two sure does\Nbring me back to the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow the four of us to take\Ncare of the two-headed snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we shall deal\Nwith the crocodile fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please make sure to keep your\Nfootwear safe from any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I expect anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll keep Boxo safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll help you take out\Nthe crocodile fiends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make him pincushions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I could use a pair\Nof nice crocodile-skin boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Betty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry, I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roaring strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anyone spotted whoever is\Ncommanding the monsters yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, Boxxo? Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem this battle isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose this means we were\Ntheir main target all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do believe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just me or is that the Stratum\NLord you defeated, Master Boxo? Or Ek?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, make sure you don't\Nget eaten this time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have to bring that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, stop it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what did you do to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made it so that the Stratum Lord's\Nbody is now several times heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn. Take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows gravity magic too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, today's the day I'll\Nfinally surpass you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you manage it, I'll give\Nyou my bow as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alanis, throw me at his other leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to be thrown?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was aiming for a different leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, it turned out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should do my part, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-chaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it for much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knew exactly what I had\Nin mind next. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:15:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'd rather you didn't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know I've got to have\Nfaith in my partner. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a high-altitude form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the biggest\Nvending machine in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Equipped with concrete foundation\Nblocks for added weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how the Stratum Lord likes this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.95,0:16:18.95,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40\c&H091984&\3c&HA9A8AA&\shad0\bord4\pos(270,20)}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, that was masterfully done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, pepper, apple, apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a huge relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried I might have thrown\Nyou a little too high up. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should put a stop to the\NNetherlord's plans for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it bugs me that Pinky\NGeneral Kyolings got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we ought to\Ncelebrate this victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I drink way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, please give me something\Nthat'll make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get one of those as well? Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean sports drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all should learn to really\Nhold your liquor better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're all back on your feet soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be open today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come visit us, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you drank several\Ntimes more than we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes her a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've defeated an eight-legged\Ncrocodile stratum lord, my point total is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3,240,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually gathered up\Nover 3 million points!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that I've finally cleared\Nthat milestone, you guessed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rank 3 is within my reach at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be just a dream anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, I was reincarnated in\Nanother world as a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've used my vending machine knowledge\Nto turn into different models.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Lamas was worried about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but ever since I beat that\Neight-legged crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to reach rank 2 and saw\Nrank 3 in my function list,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.19,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(77,104)\fs40\fsp6\bord0\shad0}Rank 3
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but be\Ncurious about what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's finally within reach!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.41,0:18:25.41,sign_Arial,text (left),0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(25,55)\c&H2C2821&\bord0\shad0\fs30\fsp6}Rank Up
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.41,0:18:28.66,sign_Arial,text (right),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&HFDFEFE&\t(4985,5111,\c&H2B2924&)\bord0\shad0\fs30\pos(435,45)}Blessings x 3
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this many points saved up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could totally spend them all\Nto learn three new blessings.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.41,0:18:28.66,sign_Arial,text (left),0,0,0,,{\an1\move(25,55,122,85,1779,3250)\c&HC4C6C6&\bord0\shad0\fs30\fsp6\t(1,194,\c&HF2FBFC&)\t(2154,3250,\fs40)}Rank Up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no, I'm going to increase\Nmy rank no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to keep growing in order to help my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends face whatever\Nchallenges come our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am definitely not letting my vending\Nmachine obsession take control here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can believe me on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am making this choice\Nfor my friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, so maybe there's a teensy\Npart of it that's for me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, there's no time\Nlike the present for that rank up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to invest those three\Nmillion points I've been saving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your painting machine rank has\Nincreased from two to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel a new power\Ncoursing through my metal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what rank three is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't scrolled through\Nmy mental cursor in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The effective range of blessings\Nand telekinesis has been doubled.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.59,0:19:28.97,sign_Arial,text (leftmost column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\bord4\shad0\fad(2277,2680)\3c&H36150F&}Investigate\N{\c&HF8F1F3&\3c&H371710&}Sleep\NConserve Power\NInspect\NGoods\NInventory\NStatus\NFunctions\NAbilities\N\N{\3c&HFDF1F0&\c&H36150F&}Blessings
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.59,0:19:28.97,sign_Arial,text (2nd column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&HFDF1F0&\c&H36150F&\fs8\bord4\shad0\fad(2277,2680)\pos(236,18)}Barrier\N\N{\c&HF8F1F3&\3c&H371710&}Telepathy\NAbsorption\NRobbery\NSwordsmanship\NMartial Arts\NBad Luck\NAttract Monsters\NMight\NCurse
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.84,0:19:28.97,sign_Arial,text (3rd column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\bord4\shad0\fad(2277,2680)\3c&H34140E&\pos(300,21)}Aging\NHardening\NRelocation\NSummoning\NNecromancy\NPseudo-Life Creation\NSensory Manipulation\NRoar\NEnhanced Recovery\N Sense Presence
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.01,0:19:28.97,sign_Arial,text (bottom pane),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\bord4\shad0\fad(2277,2680)\3c&H36150F&\pos(277,270)}Time allowed to change form into other vending machines increases\Nfrom 2 hours\Nto 4 hours.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.38,0:19:28.98,sign_Arial,text (4th column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\bord4\shad0\fad(2277,2680)\3c&H36150F&\pos(373,84)}Calculation\NComprehension\NErudition\NEducation\NMemory Power\NDurability\NOriginality\NTaste Insensitivity\N Makeup\NAttentive Listening
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.88,0:19:28.98,sign_Arial,text (rightmost column; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\bord4\shad0\fad(2277,2680)\3c&H36150F&\pos(442,35)}Decay\NMute\NDeodorize\NIntuition\NAuditory Hallucination\NSoothing Light\NReasoning\NAbnormal Status Resistance\N Mental Disorder Resistance\N Charm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh that's a nice quality of life change.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things like my barrier and telekinesis\Nget more useful the more range they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time allowed to change\Nform into other vending
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.97,0:19:34.94,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs12\bord4\shad0\3c&H36150F&\pos(255,146)}Time allowed to change form into other vending machines increases\Nfrom 2 hours\N to 4 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,machines increases from\Ntwo hours to four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.30,0:19:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yes please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There have been things I couldn't\Ndo because of the time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So doubling it gives me more\Nroom to dream more vending
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,machines and functions are\Nnow available for selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is now possible for you to transform\Ninto any vending machine that exists
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.58,0:19:56.88,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs40\c&H091984&\3c&HA9A8AA&\shad0\bord4}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or has ever existed in the past including\Nnever purchased never used models.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can choose from vending\Nmachines from foreign countries
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even older models that\Nused to be around but have been
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discontinued.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could pick something\Nfrom the UK or or that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one from the US.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.45,0:20:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting really fired up. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, there are even\Nthrowback models in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to go crazy\Nfrom sheer joy. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean I could choose that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's possible, it would make\Nconquering the everlasting stratum a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I haven't been this\Nhyped in a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.91,0:20:37.08,sign_Arial,text (top row; left to right; full pan),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H50&\3c&H6C4D48&\shad0\bord2\move(29,152,-65,152)\q2\fade(1,350)}Coin-op Vacuum Cleaner\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hRice Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hBalloon Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCardboard Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCoin-op Laundry Dryer\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPower Washer
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.91,0:20:37.08,sign_Arial,text (bottom row; left to right; full pan),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H50&\3c&H6C4D48&\shad0\bord2\move(29,320,-65,320\q2}\h\hBuddha Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCosmetics Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hHot Spring Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hJukebox\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSelf-serve Gas Pump
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I reached rank two,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the new functions I got were additional\Nself-service models and optional add-ons.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.83,0:20:47.18,sign_Arial,text (top row; left to right; full pan),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H6C4D48&\shad0\bord2\fade(300,1)\3aH&50&\move(172,152,-400,152)\q2}Shaved Ice Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAroma Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\hIce Cream Vending Machine\h\h\h\hConvenience Store Vending Machine\h\hChildren's Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPachinko Ball Dispenser\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCoin Lockers
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.83,0:20:47.18,sign_Arial,text (bottom row; left to right; full pan),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H6C4D48&\shad0\bord2\fade(300,1)\3aH&50&\move(38,324,-534,324)\q2}\h\h\hGiant Ice Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hApple Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hManzai Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hUdon Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hHamburger Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hMulti-function Copier\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFishing Bait Vending Machine\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCoin-op Binoculars\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCapsule Toy Dispenser\h\h\h\h\hGourmet Ice Cream Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those concrete slabs I've been using so\Nmuch lately were part of that package so i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wonder what's going to get added now that\Ni'm ranked three the possibilities boggle
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.76,0:20:47.18,sign_Arial,text (top row; left to right; full pan),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H6C4D48&\shad0\bord2\fade(300,1)\3aH&50&\q2\move(640,127,508,127)}Mini Dog Food Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the mind i spent the rest of the night\Npouring over the new vending machines and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goods i had at my disposal and at no point
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did i even start to feel bored sweet sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.02,0:21:02.65,sign_Arial,credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Translation:\N{\fs18.5}Duane Johnson\N\N{\fs15}Timing:\N{\fs18.5}Edgar Cruz\N\N{\fs15}Editing:\N{\fs18.5}Alicia Ashby\N\N{\fs15}Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Salem Alabanza\N\N{\fs15}Final Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't want to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you to be in the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye yeah you're\Nright it's not like we're
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,marching to our deaths agreed\Nit's just going to be a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.28,0:22:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quick one or two year\Njourney no point in getting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All mopey about it, yay me\Nand Boxxo constantly together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.84,0:22:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a dream i'm glad to\Nget the chance to go on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An adventure with Master\NBoxxo with this group, I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure we won't get bored\Neven if this takes years to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complete right time to\Nactivate the transfer circle
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the everlasting stratum.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.13,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.13,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs19.5\fsp0\pos(340,297.8)\fscx90}Yesterday's Enemies Are Today's...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.82,0:23:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

